 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for MuscleBidsMerge, MuscleBidsSegment, \
MuscleBidsTractography and MuscleBidsAnalysis. If ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["True",
   BaseStyle->"Link"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c0aed92e-0593-4748-a9a6-44d389bb32cf"],
 " (default) a result is redone when one of its inputs was redone after it, \
and a step is skipped when its input is older than the input's own inputs. If \
False only the check status and version are used, as before version 5.4."
}], "Usage",
